      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GREAT TERMS (1) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when sixth (30.19) in a Grade 5 at this track. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. ROXY CAMBLA (8) has a strong record this trip with four wins and three placings from eight starts. Comes off a (29.87) win last time, scoring by 2 lengths in a OPEN over 510m at Rockhampton. Can feature with the right run. FLYAWAY JACK (2) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 520m at this track, taking a Grade 5 in a speedy 29.76. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. MALAWI REBEL (4) is building a nice picket fence and can add to the tally.",
